node_modules/
dist/
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
# ⛔ `.env*`, NOT `.env` + `.env.*` — the second pattern requires a literal dot,
# so it does NOT match `.env copy`, the duplicate a Finder/editor action creates.
# Measured elsewhere in the factory: that exact gap put three credential-bearing
# files on a PUBLIC remote, one with a live wallet mnemonic. This repo is public
# and `.env.preview` holds a mnemonic, so the gap mattered here too.
# ⚠ Checked with `git check-ignore -v` against the filenames this repo's own docs
# tell people to create — a pattern is only as good as the names in use.
.env*
.DS_Store

# Yaci DevKit droppings (created when running yaci-devkit from the repo root)
logs/
yaci-cli.history

# Local iteration artefacts. `npm pack` output is handed to a consumer by path
# so the PACKAGING BOUNDARY gets tested — npm link and file: deps honour
# `exports` but NOT `files`, so anything missing from `files` resolves locally
# and 404s on publish. Never commit the tarball itself.
*.tgz
